<h1>6. Live 5-Minute Demo Script</h1>
<ul>
    <li><strong>0:00 - 1:00:</strong> Introduce Sialkot's export challenge under FDA 76-01. Open Order PO-8821 for 5,000 Mayo Dissecting Scissors ($48,500 USD). Run compliance evaluation -> Status: GAP DETECTED.</li>
    <li><strong>1:00 - 2:00:</strong> Open Evidence Vault & Ledger. Demonstrate 42-block cryptographic chain. Inspect flagged Mill Test Certificate with a 284-day backdating discrepancy -> Downgraded to SELF_DECLARED.</li>
    <li><strong>2:00 - 3:15:</strong> Run 10,000 Monte Carlo iterations. Show that deterministic 11 days is misleading: real P(on-time) is only 64.2% with a P90 delivery of Nov 26. Tornado chart proves ASTM A967 Passivation Lab backlog drives 82% of schedule variance.</li>
    <li><strong>3:15 - 4:15:</strong> Switch to Mock FDA QMSR Inspection Simulator. Answer 32 questions -> Score: 58/100 (HIGH RISK). Simulator generates a simulated FDA Form 483 observation citing 21 CFR 820.75 for unvalidated passivation baths.</li>
    <li><strong>4:15 - 5:00:</strong> Fast-track testing via expedited lab option -> P(on-time) surges to 94.2%. Export Gatekeeper unlocks commercial invoice and generates Traceable Audit PDF with cryptographic hash stamp.</li>
</ul>

